samples/talk.mp4 - public domain (United States government work)

talk.mp4 is a 15.4-second trim of a NASA video: Gavin Schmidt (NASA GISS) answering "Where does 2021 rank for global
temperatures?", from NASA Scientific Visualization Studio item SVS14069 ("The Numbers Are In: Where Does 2021 Rank
for Global Temperatures - Live Shots", Gavin Canned Interview pt 2), as published on Wikimedia Commons:
https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Numbers_Are_In-_Where_Does_2021_Rank_for_Global_Temperatures_Live_Shots_(SVS14069_-_Gavin_Canned_Interview_pt_2).webm
https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/14069

Works created by NASA employees as part of their official duties are not subject to copyright in the United States
(17 U.S.C. 105). NASA's media guidelines apply: https://www.nasa.gov/nasa-brand-center/images-and-media/
The clip is used only as a demo input for this project. It does not imply NASA's endorsement of AI Video Editor.

The changes made for this project (trimming from 0:05.5 to 0:20.9, scaling to 1280x720 and re-encoding; see make-talk.sh)
are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
